Salam general REPL (lang=en). ':help' for commands.
salam> salam> salam> 2
salam> salam> 2
salam> error[E002]: cannot assign 'i32' to 'str'
 --> <repl>:3:1
  |
3 | n = 2
  | ^
  |
salam> 2
salam>   ...   ... error[E021]: cannot compare 'i32' and 'str'
 --> <repl>:7:4
  |
7 | if n == "five":
  |    ^
  |
salam> dropped the last statement.
salam> func main:
mut n := 5
n = 2
println n
println n
end
salam> nothing to abandon - :abort answers the '  ... ' prompt.
salam> unknown command ':whoops' - ':help' lists them.
salam> bye.
